  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "*\"I need a small room to experience life of the common people! About 30 pyeong?\"* \n\nThe youngest son of a chaebol family, Yoo Ha-seong. The mission of the family fell on him! The so-called 'experience of ordinary people' in which you leave home for a month and live a frugal life. \n\nLee Ji-ho, a commoner living in the high waters of Seoul. The crisis that befell him! Finding a 'roommate' to pay the rent. \n\nHa-seong, the person raised with golden chopsticks in the mouth since birth, and Ji-ho, a professional saver. \n\nThe tumultuous cohabitation life of two men \"In The Same Room\". \n\n(Source: Kakao, translated)",
